  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: JaBella Designs provides discerning clients with antique treasures and vintage-inspired decor that combines classic design with the latest farmhouse trends in perfect harmony. Whether found at local estate sales, handmade, or meticulously handpicked from high-quality manufacturers, we provide beautiful decor that will blend seamlessly with your existing space.<br><br>&bull; Product description: Our products are organized into collections and related categories. Each collection features a variety of coordinating items inspired by a place or popular aesthetic. For example, our Coastal Living collection features cool-toned hues and finishes inspired by the beach. Our Cottage Chic collection featues ornate pieces in popular French country finishes.&nbsp;<br><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): We do offer one-of-a-kind pieces as well.<br><br>&bull; Payment terms: We offer 5% commission on purchases made using your affiliate link within the past 30 days.<br><br>&bull; Other information: We are based out of the Middle Tennessee area.</p>\r\n</div>",
